      "mergeID": "6307c56af28b2f62608ae9ea",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The thumbnail images on the user profile page have the image size specified by the \"user-img-16x9\" (new caraly image) or \"user-img\" (avatar thumbnail) class. However, when the window width is between 768px and 1920px, the image is displayed stretched vertically. This is because the size is overridden by flexbox, but you can avoid this by specifying auto for the height of this img.",
